#RUNOFF2MDOC.IMP -- THE RUNOFF SOURCE OF THE IMP72 MANUAL (DOCS/MANUAL/IMP.RNO) AS AN MDOC(7) PAGE (UTF-8), DOCS/MANUAL/IMP.7.  THE COMPILER OF THE TREE BUILDS IT (SH TOOLS/IMPTOOL.SH RUNOFF2MDOC DECUS/IMP.RNO).

    RUNOFF2MDOC IMP.RNO [FIXES] > IMP.7        (FIXES: TOOLS/RUNOFF-FIXES.TXT, IF NOT NAMED)

THE SOURCE IS TYPED IN CAPITALS AND RUNOFF LOWERS THEM: ^ RAISES THE NEXT LETTER, ^^ ... TWO BACKSLASHES RAISES EVERYTHING BETWEEN, ^[ ... ^] IS CODE KEPT AS TYPED (A LITERAL, LI), ^& ... \& UNDERLINES, AND AN UNDERSCORE QUOTES THE NEXT CHARACTER.
WHOLE WORDS WITH EVERY LETTER RAISED (^G^O, ^N^O^T) ARE IMP WORDS OR NAMES; A LONE RAISED LETTER (^A) IS A VARIABLE OF THE DESCRIPTION; WORDS THAT MIX LETTERS AND OPERATORS (^A=>^B) ARE CODE; THE QUOTES THE AUTHOR
TYPED AROUND CODE BECOME LITERAL QUOTES.  THAT IS THE SEMANTIC MARKUP: IC FOR WORDS OF THE LANGUAGE, AR FOR THE VARIABLES OF A DESCRIPTION, LI FOR CODE, PA FOR FILE NAMES, DQ/SQ FOR QUOTED PROSE.
LAYOUT COMMANDS: .SUBTITLE (A HEADING), .PARAGRAPH, .SKIP AND .BREAK (A NEW PARAGRAPH), .INDENT -N AND .LEFT MARGIN (LISTS AND INDENTED BLOCKS), .NOFILL/.FILL (A LITERAL BLOCK), .CENTER (THE HEADING THAT
FOLLOWS .SUBTITLE IS DROPPED).  .INDEX, .PAGE, .TEST, .RIGHT MARGIN, .TAB STOPS, .SPACING, .NUMBER, .JUSTIFY, .TITLE AND .PRINT ONLY AFFECT THE PAPER AND ARE DROPPED.  TOOLS/RUNOFF-FIXES.TXT CORRECTS THE
TYPING MISTAKES OF THE SOURCE: "OLD<TAB>NEW" LINES APPLIED TO THE TEXT AFTER THE CASE FLAGS ARE RESOLVED.
(THIS REPLACES A PYTHON PROGRAM; THE PAGE IT WRITES IS THE SAME, BYTE FOR BYTE.)  THE COMPILER NAMES ONLY 2047 REGISTERS (VALUES, CALLS, COMPARISONS, TEXT CONSTANTS) IN A FILE, SO THE PROGRAM IS IN THREE FILES, THIS ONE (THE
MAIN PROGRAM AND THE STRING AND LIST ROUTINES), TOOLS/RUNOFF2MDOC-TEXT.IMP (THE WORDS AND THEIR MARKUP) AND TOOLS/RUNOFF2MDOC-PAGE.IMP (THE LAYOUT); TOOLS/IMPTOOL.SH COMPILES THE THREE TOGETHER.

THE PROGRAM IS THE PYTHON ONE TRANSLATED STEP BY STEP, AND ITS NAMES ARE THE NAMES OF THAT PROGRAM WHERE THERE WAS ONE.  WHAT IMP MAKES DIFFERENT, FOR THE READER: A STRING IS A C STRING (A POINTER TO BYTES, A ZERO AFTER
THEM; EVERY ONE THIS PROGRAM MAKES IS FOLLOWED BY AT LEAST 16 ZEROS, SO THAT A LOOK ONE OR TWO BYTES PAST ITS END IS SAFE); A LIST IS A BLOCK OF THREE WORDS (COUNT, CAPACITY, ITEMS); A TOKEN IS A BLOCK
OF SEVEN WORDS (KIND, TEXT, PRE, POST, SUFFIX, TOKENS OF A GROUP, QUOTE).  THE LOCALS OF A ROUTINE ARE STATIC, SO NOTHING IN HERE CALLS ITSELF: GROUP_QUOTES AND EMIT_PAR, WHICH THE PYTHON WROTE AS RECURSIONS,
KEEP A WORK LIST AND A STACK OF THEIR OWN.  AN ARGUMENT IS PASSED BY REFERENCE AND AN ARGUMENT THAT IS AN EXPRESSION IS EVALUATED INTO A TEMPORARY THAT BELONGS TO THE CALLED ROUTINE, SO A CALL NEVER HAS AN
ARITHMETIC EXPRESSION FOR AN ARGUMENT WHEN ANOTHER ARGUMENT OF THE SAME CALL IS A CALL; AND A ROUTINE NEVER ASSIGNS TO ITS ARGUMENTS.#

LET KW=1, KIC=2, KAR=3, KLI=4, KPA=5, KSY=6, KNAME=7, KGROUP=8;
LET F_KIND=0, F_TEXT=1, F_PRE=2, F_POST=3, F_SUF=4, F_TOKS=5, F_QUOTE=6;
LET SP=32, DQ=34, SQ=39, BS=92, HAT=94, LF=10;
# THE VARIABLES THE MODULES SHARE (THE SAME DECLARATIONS IN EACH OF THE THREE FILES; A VARIABLE THAT IS NOT COMMON BELONGS TO ITS FILE) #
ARGW,FIXPATH,FIXOLD,FIXNEW,CASER,SPANS,OUT,EV,ST_LIST,ST_ITEM,ST_SUB,ST_RAG,ST_FIRSTPAR,ST_LIT,ST_PP,ST_MARGIN,CRT,CRF,GQ_TODO ARE COMMON;
NAMES_SET,MACROS_SET,VARNEXT_SET,EMPH_SET,PLAIN_SET,PAPER_SET,FILEEXT_SET,ABBR1_L,ABBR2_L ARE COMMON;
SET_PRE,SET_POST,SET_QPOST,SET_BPOST,UPPER_SET,LOWER_SET,ALPHA_SET,ALNUM_SET,ALNUMUP_SET,DIGIT_SET,CAPSPACE_SET,PUNCT3,PUNCT4,SPACES_SET ARE COMMON;
TABSTR,MARK1,MARK2,MARK3,EMDASH,TDASH,RSQ,LDQ,RDQ,ORDTH ARE COMMON;
CMDW,CMDA,FMHEAD,FMBODY,FFHEAD,FFBODY,FNNAME,NH_TAG,NH_BODY,MR_G1,MR_G2,M2_G1,M2_G2 ARE COMMON;
NA ARE COMMON;

# THE MAIN PROGRAM #
NA:=CCALL impargc(0);
NA<2 => DIE(LOC('usage: runoff2mdoc IMP.RNO [FIXES]'),LOC(' '));
IMPARGET(LOC(ARGW),impargvp(0),1);
FIXPATH:=LOC('tools/runoff-fixes.txt');
NA>2 => (IMPARGET(LOC(FIXPATH),impargvp(0),2));
MAIN(ARGW);
CCALL fflush(IMPSTDOUT(0));
CCALL exit(0);

# THE BYTE I OF THE MEMORY AT P, AND STORING ONE #
SUBR GETB(P,I) IS (
 Q ARE LOCAL;
 I<0 => DIE(LOC('GETB: a read before the start of a string at index '),LOC('-'));   # (AN AND OF RELATIONS EVALUATES BOTH SIDES, SO A GUARD IN FRONT OF AN INDEX READ MUST BE =>; THIS FAILS EVERYWHERE, NOT ONLY WHERE THE BYTE BEFORE A STRING IS NOT MAPPED) #
 Q:=BYTEP [P]<7,36>; Q:=Q+I; <+Q>);

SUBR PUTB(P,I,V) IS (
 Q ARE LOCAL;
 Q:=BYTEP [P]<7,36>; Q:=Q+I; <+Q>:=V; 0);

# THE WORD I OF THE BLOCK AT P, AND STORING ONE #
SUBR RD(P,I) IS (
 Q ARE LOCAL;
 Q:=P+(8*I); [Q]);

SUBR WR(P,I,V) IS (
 Q ARE LOCAL;
 Q:=P+(8*I); [Q]:=V; 0);

SUBR DIE(M,A) IS (
 NL ARE LOCAL;
 CCALL write(2,M,CCALL strlen(M)); CCALL write(2,LOC(': '),2); CCALL write(2,A,CCALL strlen(A));
 NL:=CCALL calloc(16,1); PUTB(NL,0,10); CCALL write(2,NL,1); CCALL exit(1));

# THE EMPTY STRING (A TEXT CONSTANT CANNOT BE EMPTY: TWO APOSTROPHES ARE ONE) #
SUBR S_E(Z) IS CCALL calloc(16,1);

# A LIST OF WORDS: [COUNT, CAPACITY, ITEMS] #
SUBR L_NEW(Z) IS (
 B ARE LOCAL;
 B:=CCALL calloc(3,8); WR(B,1,8); WR(B,2,CCALL calloc(8,8)); B);

SUBR L_ADD(B,V) IS (
 N,CAP,P,NP,C2 ARE LOCAL;
 N:=RD(B,0); CAP:=RD(B,1); P:=RD(B,2);
 N=CAP => (C2:=CAP*2; NP:=CCALL calloc(C2,8); CCALL memcpy(NP,P,CAP*8); WR(B,1,C2); WR(B,2,NP); P:=NP);
 WR(P,N,V); N:=N+1; WR(B,0,N); 0);

SUBR L_GET(B,I) IS (
 P ARE LOCAL;
 P:=RD(B,2); RD(P,I));

SUBR L_SET(B,I,V) IS (
 P ARE LOCAL;
 P:=RD(B,2); WR(P,I,V));

SUBR L_LEN(B) IS RD(B,0);

# THE LAST ITEM, TAKEN OFF #
SUBR L_POP(B) IS (
 N ARE LOCAL;
 N:=RD(B,0)-1; WR(B,0,N); L_GET(B,N));

# THE ITEM I TAKEN OUT (THE ONES AFTER IT MOVE UP) #
SUBR L_DEL1(B,I) IS (
 N,K,V ARE LOCAL;
 N:=RD(B,0); V:=L_GET(B,I); K:=I;
 WHILE (K+1)<N DO (L_SET(B,K,L_GET(B,K+1)); K:=K+1);
 N:=N-1; WR(B,0,N); V);

# THE ITEMS I TO J (EXCLUSIVE) TAKEN OUT #
SUBR L_DELR(B,I,J) IS (
 N,K,D ARE LOCAL;
 N:=RD(B,0); D:=J-I; K:=I;
 WHILE (K+D)<N DO (L_SET(B,K,L_GET(B,K+D)); K:=K+1);
 N:=N-D; WR(B,0,N); 0);

# V PUT IN BEFORE THE ITEM I #
SUBR L_INS(B,I,V) IS (
 N,K ARE LOCAL;
 L_ADD(B,V);
 N:=RD(B,0)-1; K:=N;
 WHILE K>I DO (L_SET(B,K,L_GET(B,K-1)); K:=K-1);
 L_SET(B,I,V); 0);

# A NEW LIST OF THE ITEMS I TO J (EXCLUSIVE) #
SUBR L_SLICE(B,I,J) IS (
 R,K ARE LOCAL;
 R:=L_NEW(0); K:=I;
 WHILE K<J DO (L_ADD(R,L_GET(B,K)); K:=K+1);
 R);

# THE ITEMS OF LIST A AFTER THE ITEMS OF LIST B #
SUBR L_EXT(B,A) IS (
 K,N ARE LOCAL;
 N:=RD(A,0); K:=0;
 WHILE K<N DO (L_ADD(B,L_GET(A,K)); K:=K+1);
 0);

# A BUFFER OF BYTES THAT GROWS: [LENGTH, CAPACITY, BYTES]; ITS BYTES ARE ALWAYS FOLLOWED BY ZEROS #
SUBR B_NEW(Z) IS (
 B ARE LOCAL;
 B:=CCALL calloc(3,8); WR(B,1,64); WR(B,2,CCALL calloc(80,1)); B);

SUBR B_CH(B,C) IS (
 N,CAP,P,NP,C2 ARE LOCAL;
 N:=RD(B,0); CAP:=RD(B,1); P:=RD(B,2);
 (N+2)>CAP => (C2:=CAP*2; NP:=CCALL calloc(C2+16,1); CCALL memcpy(NP,P,N); WR(B,1,C2); WR(B,2,NP); CCALL free(P); P:=NP);
 PUTB(P,N,C); N:=N+1; WR(B,0,N); 0);

SUBR B_STR(B,S) IS (
 I,N,C ARE LOCAL;
 N:=CCALL strlen(S); I:=0;
 WHILE I<N DO (C:=GETB(S,I); B_CH(B,C); I:=I+1);
 0);

# THE BYTES OF THE BUFFER AS A NEW STRING #
SUBR B_GET(B) IS (
 N,S,P ARE LOCAL;
 N:=RD(B,0); P:=RD(B,2); S:=CCALL calloc(N+16,1); CCALL memcpy(S,P,N); S);

SUBR S_LEN(S) IS CCALL strlen(S);

# THE NUMBER OF CHARACTERS OF A UTF-8 STRING (PYTHON'S LEN): THE BYTES THAT ARE NOT CONTINUATIONS #
SUBR S_CLEN(S) IS (
 I,N,K,C,D ARE LOCAL;
 N:=CCALL strlen(S); I:=0; K:=0;
 WHILE I<N DO (C:=GETB(S,I); D:=C AND 192; D NE 128 => K:=K+1; I:=I+1);
 K);

SUBR S_DUP(S) IS (
 N,R ARE LOCAL;
 N:=CCALL strlen(S); R:=CCALL calloc(N+16,1); CCALL memcpy(R,S,N); R);

# THE STRINGS A AND B JOINED #
SUBR S_CAT(A,B) IS (
 NA,NB,R,Q ARE LOCAL;
 NA:=CCALL strlen(A); NB:=CCALL strlen(B); R:=CCALL calloc((NA+NB)+16,1);
 CCALL memcpy(R,A,NA); Q:=R+NA; CCALL memcpy(Q,B,NB); R);

SUBR S_CAT3(A,B,C) IS (
 R ARE LOCAL;
 R:=S_CAT(A,B); S_CAT(R,C));

# THE BYTES I TO J (EXCLUSIVE) OF S #
SUBR S_SUB(S,I,J) IS (
 R,Q,L ARE LOCAL;
 L:=J-I; R:=CCALL calloc(L+16,1); Q:=S+I; CCALL memcpy(R,Q,L); R);

# THE BYTES FROM I TO THE END #
SUBR S_FROM(S,I) IS (
 N ARE LOCAL;
 N:=CCALL strlen(S); S_SUB(S,I,N));

# A STRING OF ONE CHARACTER #
SUBR S_C(C) IS (
 R ARE LOCAL;
 R:=CCALL calloc(16,1); PUTB(R,0,C); R);

SUBR S_EQ(A,B) IS ((CCALL strcmp(A,B) AND 4294967295)=0);

# DOES A START WITH P #
SUBR S_STARTS(A,P) IS (
 N ARE LOCAL;
 N:=CCALL strlen(P); (CCALL strncmp(A,P,N) AND 4294967295)=0);

# DOES A END WITH P #
SUBR S_ENDS(A,P) IS (
 NA,NP,Q ARE LOCAL;
 NA:=CCALL strlen(A); NP:=CCALL strlen(P);
 NP>NA => RETURN 0;
 Q:=A+(NA-NP); (CCALL strcmp(Q,P) AND 4294967295)=0);

# THE INDEX OF THE FIRST S AT OR AFTER F IN A, OR -1 #
SUBR S_INDEX(A,S,F) IS (
 Q,P ARE LOCAL;
 Q:=A+F; P:=CCALL strstr(Q,S);
 P=0 => RETURN -1;
 P-A);

# A WITH EVERY OLD REPLACED BY NEW #
SUBR S_REPL(A,OLD,NEW) IS (
 B,I,N,NO,P ARE LOCAL;
 NO:=CCALL strlen(OLD);
 NO=0 => RETURN A;
 B:=B_NEW(0); I:=0; N:=CCALL strlen(A);
 WHILE I<N DO (
    P:=S_INDEX(A,OLD,I);
    P<0 => (B_STR(B,S_FROM(A,I)); I:=N)
    ELSE (B_STR(B,S_SUB(A,I,P)); B_STR(B,NEW); I:=P+NO));
 B_GET(B));

SUBR IS_SPACE(C) IS ((C=32) OR ((C>8) AND (C<14)) OR ((C>27) AND (C<32)));

SUBR IS_DIG(C) IS ((C>47) AND (C<58));

SUBR IS_UP(C) IS ((C>64) AND (C<91));

SUBR IS_LOW(C) IS ((C>96) AND (C<123));

SUBR IS_ALPHA(C) IS (((C>64) AND (C<91)) OR ((C>96) AND (C<123)));

SUBR IS_ALNUM(C) IS (((C>64) AND (C<91)) OR ((C>96) AND (C<123)) OR ((C>47) AND (C<58)));

# A WORD CHARACTER OF PYTHON'S RE: LETTER, DIGIT OR UNDERSCORE #
SUBR IS_W(C) IS (((C>64) AND (C<91)) OR ((C>96) AND (C<123)) OR ((C>47) AND (C<58)) OR (C=95));

SUBR TO_UPPER(C) IS (((C>96) AND (C<123)) => C-32 ELSE C);

SUBR TO_LOWER(C) IS (((C>64) AND (C<91)) => C+32 ELSE C);

# IS THE CHARACTER C IN THE STRING SET #
SUBR IN_SET(C,SET) IS (
 C=0 => RETURN 0;
 CCALL strchr(SET,C) NE 0);

# ARE THE CHARACTERS OF W FROM F ON ALL IN SET #
SUBR ALL_IN(W,F,SET) IS (
 I,N,C ARE LOCAL;
 N:=CCALL strlen(W); I:=F;
 WHILE I<N DO (C:=GETB(W,I); IN_SET(C,SET)=0 => RETURN 0; I:=I+1);
 1);

# THE NUMBER OF THE CHARACTER C IN S #
SUBR S_COUNT(S,C) IS (
 I,N,K ARE LOCAL;
 N:=CCALL strlen(S); I:=0; K:=0;
 WHILE I<N DO (GETB(S,I)=C => K:=K+1; I:=I+1);
 K);

# IS THERE ANY CHARACTER OF SET IN S #
SUBR S_ANY(S,SET) IS (
 I,N ARE LOCAL;
 N:=CCALL strlen(S); I:=0;
 WHILE I<N DO (IN_SET(GETB(S,I),SET) NE 0 => RETURN 1; I:=I+1);
 0);

SUBR S_UPPER(S) IS (
 I,N,B ARE LOCAL;
 N:=CCALL strlen(S); B:=B_NEW(0); I:=0;
 WHILE I<N DO (B_CH(B,TO_UPPER(GETB(S,I))); I:=I+1);
 B_GET(B));

SUBR S_LOWER(S) IS (
 I,N,B ARE LOCAL;
 N:=CCALL strlen(S); B:=B_NEW(0); I:=0;
 WHILE I<N DO (B_CH(B,TO_LOWER(GETB(S,I))); I:=I+1);
 B_GET(B));

# PYTHON'S STRIP, LSTRIP AND RSTRIP #
SUBR S_STRIP(S) IS (
 I,J,F ARE LOCAL;
 I:=0; J:=CCALL strlen(S); F:=1;
 WHILE F NE 0 DO (I<J => (IS_SPACE(GETB(S,I)) => I:=I+1 ELSE F:=0) ELSE F:=0);
 F:=1;
 WHILE F NE 0 DO (J>I => (IS_SPACE(GETB(S,J-1)) => J:=J-1 ELSE F:=0) ELSE F:=0);
 S_SUB(S,I,J));

SUBR S_RSTRIP(S) IS (
 J,F ARE LOCAL;
 J:=CCALL strlen(S); F:=1;
 WHILE F NE 0 DO (J>0 => (IS_SPACE(GETB(S,J-1)) => J:=J-1 ELSE F:=0) ELSE F:=0);
 S_SUB(S,0,J));

SUBR S_LSTRIP(S) IS (
 I,J,F ARE LOCAL;
 I:=0; J:=CCALL strlen(S); F:=1;
 WHILE F NE 0 DO (I<J => (IS_SPACE(GETB(S,I)) => I:=I+1 ELSE F:=0) ELSE F:=0);
 S_SUB(S,I,J));

# THE RUNS OF WHITE SPACE IN S MADE ONE SPACE (PYTHON'S RE.SUB OF \S+ BY A SPACE) #
SUBR S_SQUEEZE(S) IS (
 B,I,N,C,F ARE LOCAL;
 B:=B_NEW(0); N:=CCALL strlen(S); I:=0;
 WHILE I<N DO (
    C:=GETB(S,I);
    IS_SPACE(C) => (
       B_CH(B,SP); F:=1;
       WHILE F NE 0 DO ((I+1)<N => (IS_SPACE(GETB(S,I+1)) => I:=I+1 ELSE F:=0) ELSE F:=0))
    ELSE B_CH(B,C);
    I:=I+1);
 B_GET(B));

# THE ITEMS OF LIST L (STRINGS) JOINED WITH SEP #
SUBR S_JOINL(L,SEP) IS (
 B,I,N ARE LOCAL;
 B:=B_NEW(0); N:=L_LEN(L); I:=0;
 WHILE I<N DO (
    I>0 => B_STR(B,SEP);
    B_STR(B,L_GET(L,I)); I:=I+1);
 B_GET(B));

# THE CHARACTERS OF S JOINED WITH A SPACE BETWEEN EACH #
SUBR S_JOINC(S) IS (
 B,I,N ARE LOCAL;
 B:=B_NEW(0); N:=CCALL strlen(S); I:=0;
 WHILE I<N DO (
    I>0 => B_CH(B,SP);
    B_CH(B,GETB(S,I)); I:=I+1);
 B_GET(B));

# THE NUMBER OF WORDS OF S (PYTHON'S SPLIT()) #
SUBR S_NWORDS(S) IS (
 I,N,K,IN ARE LOCAL;
 N:=CCALL strlen(S); I:=0; K:=0; IN:=0;
 WHILE I<N DO (
    IS_SPACE(GETB(S,I)) => IN:=0 ELSE (IN=0 => (K:=K+1; IN:=1));
    I:=I+1);
 K);

# THE FIRST WORD OF S (PYTHON'S SPLIT()[0]), EMPTY IF THERE IS NONE #
SUBR S_WORD1(S) IS (
 I,J,N,F ARE LOCAL;
 N:=CCALL strlen(S); I:=0; F:=1;
 WHILE F NE 0 DO (I<N => (IS_SPACE(GETB(S,I)) => I:=I+1 ELSE F:=0) ELSE F:=0);
 J:=I; F:=1;
 WHILE F NE 0 DO (J<N => (IS_SPACE(GETB(S,J)) => F:=0 ELSE J:=J+1) ELSE F:=0);
 S_SUB(S,I,J));

# IS S ONE OF THE WORDS OF THE SET, A STRING OF WORDS EACH WITH A SPACE BEFORE AND AFTER IT #
SUBR IN_WORDS(SET,S) IS (
 T,R ARE LOCAL;
 S_LEN(S)=0 => RETURN 0;
 S_ANY(S,LOC(' ')) NE 0 => RETURN 0;
 T:=S_CAT3(LOC(' '),S,LOC(' '));
 S_INDEX(SET,T,0) NE -1);

# THE NUMBER (WITH A SIGN) AT THE FRONT OF S; 0 IF THERE IS NONE #
SUBR S_INT(S) IS (
 I,V,NEG,N,F,C ARE LOCAL;
 N:=CCALL strlen(S); I:=0; V:=0; NEG:=0; F:=1;
 WHILE F NE 0 DO (I<N => (IS_SPACE(GETB(S,I)) => I:=I+1 ELSE F:=0) ELSE F:=0);
 C:=GETB(S,I);
 C=45 => (NEG:=1; I:=I+1) ELSE (C=43 => I:=I+1);
 WHILE IS_DIG(GETB(S,I)) DO (V:=(V*10)+(GETB(S,I)-48); I:=I+1);
 NEG NE 0 => V:=0-V;
 V)
%%
